/**
 * Install the discharge base fields and station (Discharge feature).
 *
 * Adds `discharge_sunglasses`, `discharge_readers` (booleans), and
 * `discharge_notes` (plain text) to already-deployed Visit tables. The new
 * `discharge` value on `current_station` is an allowed-values setting change
