 * terms. Fresh sites pick the fields up from Visit::baseFieldDefinitions() and
 * the seed from librechart_visit_install(); already-deployed sites need this
 * hook. The three reference fields are revealed on the form only when Patient
 * Type is "pediatric", via conditional_fields dependencies in the form display.
 */
